  "body": "Looking for a home that offers comfortable family living with room to grow? Welcome to 107 Weatherly Road, Torbay - a property that combines practical family living with an appealing coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nNewly renovated when purchased in 2024, the home has since been configured to offer four bedrooms, providing comfortable accommodation for growing families, extended family living, or those needing extra space to work from home.\r\n\r\nStep outside and enjoy the benefit of a separate outdoor space, ideal for relaxing, entertaining friends or enjoying time with the family. The newly installed fencing adds a fresh finish while providing extra privacy and a more defined outdoor area.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the relaxed Torbay lifestyle, with beautiful beaches, local cafés, shops and everyday amenities all within easy reach. Families will also appreciate the nearby schools and local schooling options, making this an appealing choice for those looking to put down roots on the North Shore.\r\n\r\nAdding further interest, the 640m² land may offer potential for subdivision, subject to Auckland Council approval and relevant planning requirements.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for a family home or a property with future upside, 107 Weatherly Road is well worth your inspection. Get in touch today to discover the possibilities.",
